{
 "about": "Made by tools/voices.mjs (Gemini TTS). Keyed \"<speaker>|<the exact line>\"; src/carrier/voice.mjs plays the file for a line it finds here.",
 "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
 "lines": {
  "cox|So you're the new apprentice. Welcome aboard. You're in Blue watch, berthed in quarters C. Read the watch bill on the board outside this office: it tells you when you're on, and where you muster.": {
   "file": "cox-so-you-re-the-new-apprentice-welcome-988c2e.mp3",
   "hash": "988c2ec24e",
   "voice": "voice_p5jimz0zc72a",
   "secs": 13.87
  },
  "dc|So you're Blue watch's new hand in my party. Everyone aboard fights fires before they do anything else. I'm lighting a drill fire in the gym. The red cabinets in the passages hold extinguishers. Take one, find the fire, put it out. Go.": {
   "file": "dc-so-you-re-blue-watch-s-new-hand-in-m-31394d.mp3",
   "hash": "31394dce73",
   "voice": "voice_nm8fatgcnafz",
   "secs": 13.72
  },
  "dc|Not bad. Now an electrical fault, in the electrical shop. Isolate the supply at the switchboard aft first, or it will bite you. Repair kits are in the yellow lockers.": {
   "file": "dc-not-bad-now-an-electrical-fault-in-t-e57219.mp3",
   "hash": "e57219e1c6",
   "voice": "voice_nm8fatgcnafz",
   "secs": 10.31
  },
  "dc|Mended, and you didn't get bitten. One more thing every hand on watch does: rounds. Look into the three repair lockers, forward, amidships and aft, and come back to me.": {
   "file": "dc-mended-and-you-didn-t-get-bitten-one-9d9d7c.mp3",
   "hash": "9d9d7c1af8",
   "voice": "voice_nm8fatgcnafz",
   "secs": 10.85
  },
  "dc|That's your damage control ticket. You're a crewman now, not an apprentice. The gunnery officer wants every hand who can see straight: Lieutenant Varga, at the dorsal turret trunk, starboard side, forward of the mess.": {
   "file": "dc-that-s-your-damage-control-ticket-yo-4f88b1.mp3",
   "hash": "4f88b114ea",
   "voice": "voice_nm8fatgcnafz",
   "secs": 11.55
  },
  "guns|Before you shoot at anything that shoots back, you shoot at a sled. A tug is streaming a target down our starboard side. Climb up into the dorsal turret. Lay your sight on the amber diamond, not on the sled: that is where the sled will be when your shell gets there. Three hits.": {
   "file": "guns-before-you-shoot-at-anything-that-sh-19011d.mp3",
   "hash": "19011d1a69",
   "voice": "voice_3uge17k0jmq0",
   "secs": 18.3
  },
  "guns|Hits under fire. You're a gunner. From now on, when the klaxon goes, you have a turret. And the flight officer has asked for you: Lieutenant Moss, in the pilots' ready room.": {
   "file": "guns-hits-under-fire-you-re-a-gunner-from-e0aca7.mp3",
   "hash": "e0aca75c1f",
   "voice": "voice_3uge17k0jmq0",
   "secs": 10.59
  },
  "flight|Every gunner gets a go in a fighter. Take any of them on the pads. Launch, fly about, then fly yourself home down the lane of rings. Don't call flight control to bring you in: fly it.": {
   "file": "flight-every-gunner-gets-a-go-in-a-fighter-7d7ca9.mp3",
   "hash": "7d7ca96046",
   "voice": "voice_y99kim4gm369",
   "secs": 11.83
  },
  "flight|You'll make a pilot. Not this week. Commander Reyes wants you on the bridge: she says anyone who can land a fighter can learn to steer a ship.": {
   "file": "flight-you-ll-make-a-pilot-not-this-week-co-372e07.mp3",
   "hash": "372e07557d",
   "voice": "voice_y99kim4gm369",
   "secs": 8.19
  },
  "ootw|Take the helm. Bring her round ninety degrees, either way, and stop her turning. Gently: that is four hundred metres of ship.": {
   "file": "ootw-take-the-helm-bring-her-round-ninety-190ee4.mp3",
   "hash": "190ee4e50d",
   "voice": "voice_dr6r455uf36c",
   "secs": 8.74
  },
  "ootw|Fires, guns, a fighter and the helm, in your first week. You're a helmsman. The ship is yours to serve.": {
   "file": "ootw-fires-guns-a-fighter-and-the-helm-in-7d41e7.mp3",
   "hash": "7d41e766dc",
   "voice": "voice_dr6r455uf36c",
   "secs": 10.84
  },
